{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2019-10-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'MICHAELS CUSTOMERS CAN NOW PICK UP AND DROP OFF PACKAGES AT MORE THAN 1,100 STORES NATIONWIDE THROUGH UPS ACCESS POINT® LOCATIONS', 'text': 'THE MICHAELS COMPANIES, INC., (N, AND UPS ANNOUNCE THE COMPLETE ROLLOUT OF UPS ACCESS POINT® LOCATIONS TO MORE THAN 1,100 MICHAELS COMPANIES STORES NATIONWIDE – JUST IN TIME FOR HALLOWEEN CRAFTING AND DECORATIONS. AS THE FIRST OF THE RECENTLY ANNOUNCED RETAIL PARTNERS TO OFFER UPS ACCESS POINT LOCATIONS, CUSTOMERS ARE NOW ABLE TO SHIP UPS PACKAGES DIRECTLY TO A MICHAELS STORE, AS WELL AS DROP OFF PRE-LABELED SHIPMENTS AND MAKE RETURNS TO E-COMMERCE RETAILERS THAT OFFER UPS DROP OFF, ALL WHILE PICKING UP THEIR FAVORITE SEASONAL AND DIY ESSENTIALS. FOR CUSTOMERS WHO PREFER TO HAVE THEIR DELIVERY PREFERENCES SET TO THEIR LOCAL MICHAELS, THE UPS MY CHOICE FOR HOME SOLUTION ALLOWS PACKAGES TO BE AUTOMATICALLY REROUTED TO THE MICHAELS OF THEIR CHOICE. UPS IS ALSO WORKING WITH MERCHANTS TO PROVIDE SHOPPERS THE OPTION OF SELECTING THEIR NEAREST UPS ACCESS POINT® LOCATION DURING THE CHECKOUT PROCESS.'}